C + He+ -> C+ + He          [2e3, 1e8]        2.77e-19*Tgas**(1.597)

OH + H -> O + H + H         []                6e-9*exp(-5.09e4*invT)
HOC+ + H2 -> HCO+ + H2      []                3e-10

